The precision-focused member of Hina's Drift Club. This two-tone AP1 combines a fictional approximately 330 hp naturally aspirated tune with the Honda's high-revving character, six-speed manual and compact double-wishbone chassis. Independent Hina's Drifters S2000 tyres, a progressive mechanical limited-slip differential and a smoother throttle/lift response support mid-drift line adjustment.

Start with the default setup. The S2000 rewards engine speed, clean transitions and measured corrections; its sharper response asks for accuracy rather than turbo anticipation. This is an HDC game tune, not a real-world stock specification.
